{"id":"wb-6-713","name":"宝梵寺","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"宝梵寺 (蓬溪县)","text":"宝梵寺位于四川省遂宁市蓬溪县宝梵镇宝梵村，文物遗址年代判定为明至清。1956年8月16日公布为四川省第一批历史及革命文物保护单位。1980年7月7日重新公布为四川省第一批文物保护单位。2006年5月25日列为第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AE%9D%E6%A2%B5%E5%AF%BA_(%E8%93%AC%E6%BA%AA%E5%8E%BF)","revisionId":86458635,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86458635","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/b4f54548e7b775aa8f7604fe.jpg","title":"宝梵寺照片.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E5%AE%9D%E6%A2%B5%E5%AF%BA%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/28/%E5%AE%9D%E6%A2%B5%E5%AF%BA%E7%85%A7%E7%89%87.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Baofan temple in Pengxi County, Sichuan","width":320,"height":223}}